    "notes": "The named Cầu Hàm Rồng railway way 537517258 and the paired PMTiles roadway traces identify the rebuilt crossing associated with Q4346741. The bridge crosses the Mã River east-southeast. Its rail embankments meet the sampled ground on both banks, and the separate Hoàng Long bridge stays native."
